```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Welcome to Code Assess System</title>

    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background-color: #f4f7fb;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        color: #333333;
      }

      .wrapper {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 40px 0;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 560px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }

      .header {
        padding: 28px 30px;
        background-color: #2563eb;
        color: #ffffff;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 26px;
      }

      .content {
        padding: 35px 30px;
      }

      .content h2 {
        margin-top: 0;
        font-size: 22px;
        color: #1f2937;
      }

      .content p {
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: #4b5563;
      }

      .highlight {
        margin: 25px 0;
        padding: 18px;
        background-color: #eff6ff;
        border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;
        border-radius: 6px;
      }

      .highlight p {
        margin: 0;
        color: #1e40af;
      }

      .footer {
        padding: 20px 30px;
        background-color: #f9fafb;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #9ca3af;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="container">

        <div class="header">
          <h1>Code Assess System</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
          <h2>Welcome, <%= name %>! 👋</h2>

          <p>
            Thank you for joining <strong>Code Assess System</strong>.
            Your account has been successfully created and verified.
          </p>

          <div class="highlight">
            <p>
              Your account is now ready. You can start exploring assessments,
              solving coding challenges, and tracking your progress.
            </p>
          </div>

          <p>
            We are excited to have you with us. Keep learning, keep practicing,
            and take your coding skills to the next level.
          </p>

          <p>
            If you have any questions or need assistance, please feel free to
            contact our support team.
          </p>

          <p>
            Best regards,<br />
            <strong>Code Assess System Team</strong>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
          &copy; <%= year %> Code Assess System. All rights reserved.
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
```
